     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe, and I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to **5,100 mg/day**. The labeled maximum is 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release and 2,000 mg/day for extended-release. This order is double that. The risks at this dose include lactic acidosis and GI toxicity, even with normal renal and hepatic function.\n\nSome possible intended orders:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals.** This is 2,550 mg/day, the maximum for immediate-release.\n- **1,700 mg PO per day,** divided or as a single dose.\n- **500 mg or 1,000 mg PO twice daily.**\n- Another dose you had in mind.\n\nTell me which dose you want. If 1,700 mg three times daily is what you intend, tell me that and give a short rationale for the order note. I'll enter it once you've confirmed."
      }
     ],
